id: pm-g8oh0f
title: Omit redundant read receipts when canonical output flags do not compact results
description: "Canonical output flags reportedly add a verbose read_output receipt even when every requested field and row fits, unlike equivalent legacy flags."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags: []
