acceptance_criteria: "Return compact output for no-op canonical output controls while preserving explicit audit requests and all actionable omission, fallback, truncation and continuation evidence."
parent: pm-5t33or
severity: medium
repro_steps: "Compare a one-item read with default output and --output-limit 20: reporter measured 183 bytes / 6 lines versus 572 bytes / 25 lines. Compare list 3 with legacy versus canonical flags: 875 bytes / 33 lines versus 1409 bytes / 57 lines."
expected_result: "Return compact output for no-op canonical output controls while preserving explicit audit requests and all actionable omission, fallback, truncation and continuation evidence."
actual_result: Reported behavior above; independently reproducing the exact published-version fixture remains part of implementation.
